<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35712" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνῑπή</span></b> , ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνίπτω,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνέπω</span>
			 fin.) poet. Noun, <i>rebuke, reproof,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				4.402
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρατερὴν δ᾽ ἀποθέσθαι ἐνιπήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					5.492
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνιπῇ ἀργαλέῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					14.104
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔδδεισεν γὰρ ἐμὴν ἔκπαγλον ἐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					10.448
				</span></i>
			; <i>abuse, contumely,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίσχετε θυμὸν ἐνιπῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					20.266
				</span></i>
			: pl., <i>angry threats,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φεύγων . . Ποσειδάωνος ἐνιπάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					5.446
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Merc.</u>
				165
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψευδέων ἐνιπά</span>
			<i>reproach</i> of lying, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				10(11).6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> later, of any
				<i>violent attack,</i> as of the sun's rays or thirst, <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>C.</u>
				1.133
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				299
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
